WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.484
Job one: get the work done. When people are not sure what is expected, work comes in late or quietly drops.

2
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:15.034
Four habits fix that. Plan it: three priorities, each with an owner.

3
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:21.320
Say it: what each person owns, by when, and what good looks like, in writing.

4
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:26.870
Check it: look at work while it is in progress, not on the due date.

5
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:31.115
Fix it: when something breaks twice, find the cause.

6
00:00:31.165 --> 00:00:36.094
This week, confirm with one person what they own and by when.

